 SG_ TTireRR : 56|8@1+ (1,-40) [-40|215] "degC" 718

CM_ BO_ 1651 "CANMEDIA/MMI bus (not Drive CAN). planetkris decoded per-wheel TPMS but did not publish formulas; 718forum cites candidate ID 0x673 with 4+4 byte pressure/temp layout and ~0.1 bar scaling — verify on MMI bus before use.";
CM_ SG_ 1651 pTireFL "Wheel order FL/FR/RL/RR is typical VW/Porsche but unconfirmed for 982.";

